    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Superlative",
     "texto": [
      "The superlative can express «the most» or «most»: **Toget er raskest** («The train is the fastest»). Some forms are irregular: **god – bedre – best** («good – better – best»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
